  "_comment": [
    "Manual fixes for team_logos. File names are Wikipedia/Commons file names without the 'File:' prefix.",
    "sport_country_flags: replaces a country's flag for one sport, for national teams and clubs alike.",
    "  key is '<sport>|<country>', where <country> is the Template:Country data name (as printed by team_logos).",
    "teams: per-team fixes, key is '<name>|<sport>' exactly as in matches.home/away and leagues[].sport.",
    "  Any of: wiki_title (article to use instead of searching), logo_file, flag_file, country, national (true/false),",
    "  or logo_url / flag_url: a direct image URL from anywhere, for a team with no image on Wikipedia.",
    "  Run ./team_logos --team '<name>' after editing to refresh just that team."
